    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Sunday Run is a modern take on old-school 3D platforming. Complete short levels and compete with yourself, your friends, and if you want with the global leaderboards. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.poster.avif?t=1754596052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.webm?t=1754596052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.mp4?t=1754596052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>First, it is enough to complete the level at your own pace. Then you are encouraged to beat the medal times. And after that, try to be even faster! Find shortcuts and make the mechanics work for you.<br><br>Use dashes, jump pads, grappling hook, speed platforms and more to navigate through the levels as quickly as possible.<br><br>Be smart where to use your dashes, as they only replenish by collecting coins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/39c8d2b09d7e76f0baaa3b36adfd62ca.avif?t=1754596052\" width=600 height=336 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Sunday Run is a modern take on old-school 3D platforming. Complete short levels and compete with yourself, your friends, and if you want with the global leaderboards. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.poster.avif?t=1754596052\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.webm?t=1754596052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/3b5e0865d09d863dd5fa6dac9e04078e.mp4?t=1754596052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>First, it is enough to complete the level at your own pace. Then you are encouraged to beat the medal times. And after that, try to be even faster! Find shortcuts and make the mechanics work for you.<br><br>Use dashes, jump pads, grappling hook, speed platforms and more to navigate through the levels as quickly as possible.<br><br>Be smart where to use your dashes, as they only replenish by collecting coins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848580/extras/39c8d2b09d7e76f0baaa3b36adfd62ca.avif?t=1754596052\" width=600 height=336 /></span>",
